<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/rfid">RFID</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">RFID Tags &amp; Inlays</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">RFID products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-cards" aria-label="RFID Smart Cards"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">RC</span><span class="label">RFID Smart Cards</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tags-inlays" aria-label="RFID Tags &amp; Inlays" aria-current="page"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">TI</span><span class="label">RFID Tags &amp; Inlays</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tire-tags" aria-label="RFID Tire Tags"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">TT</span><span class="label">RFID Tire Tags</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us your specifications and we&rsquo;ll take it from there.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">RFID &middot; RFID Tags &amp; Inlays</div><h1 class="mk-h1">RFID tags and inlays, including industrial and retail asset-tracking tags</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures RFID inlays and tags on automated roll-to-roll lines, including antenna, chip and strap attach, lamination, converting, electrical test, read verification and unique-ID handling. The process supports high-volume production across UHF, HF and LF formats.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-rfid-tags-inlays" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media" style="background:#F2F4F7;"><img src="/images/photos/mk-industrial-iot-card-rfid-asset-tag.webp" alt="RFID asset-tracking tag cards" style="height:auto;aspect-ratio:1 / 1;object-fit:cover;"/></div></div></section><section id="specialize-rfid-tags-inlays" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">UHF and HF inlays and straps</span></div><div class="desc">Inlay and strap production on automated roll-to-roll lines, supplied as inlay stock or converted into finished tag formats.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Ruggedized and embeddable tags</span></div><div class="desc">Hardened, rubber-embeddable and on-metal tag constructions selected according to the mounting surface and operating environment.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Sensing and battery-assisted formats</span></div><div class="desc">Temperature-sensing and battery-assisted passive RFID formats for programs requiring additional sensing or read-performance capability.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Test, encoding and unique ID</span></div><div class="desc">Electrical and read verification with encoding and unique-ID management integrated into the production process.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See RFID &amp; Smart Tags for the antenna design, chip and strap attach, converting and test processes supporting the wider tag and inlay range.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/rfid-smart-tags">Explore RFID &amp; Smart Tags <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section id="asset-tracking" class="mk-plate pl-fade" data-plate-role="capability"><div class="art"><img src="/images/mk-rfid-card-inlays.webp" alt=""/></div><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Automated roll-to-roll production</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Chip or strap placement, bonding and antenna performance are held consistent through lamination and converting, with electrical and read verification and unique-ID handling built into the line. Selected UHF tag products are <a href="/locations/ohio" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">ARC-certified through Hana&rsquo;s Ohio site</a>.</p><div class="rfid-cert" style="margin:20px 0 4px;"><div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);margin-bottom:10px;">Certifications &amp; partners</div><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:stretch;"><div style="background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;"><img src="/images/partners/impinj-nxp.webp" alt="Impinj and NXP Gold Partner" loading="lazy" style="display:block;height:44px;width:auto;"></div><div style="background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;"><img src="/images/partners/arc-quality.webp" alt="ARC Quality 2025, Auburn University RFID Lab" loading="lazy" style="display:block;height:52px;width:auto;"></div></div></div><h3 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;margin:26px 0 10px;">Industrial and retail asset-tracking tags</h3><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0;">Tags for industrial and retail tracking are built around the mounting surface and environment. Materials, encapsulation and on-metal antenna spacing are selected to suit, and read performance is verified on the finished tag.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What RFID frequencies does Hana manufacture for?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana's RFID manufacturing capability covers LF, HF and UHF. Inlay and tag production centers on UHF and HF, with the applicable band and format confirmed per program.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does roll-to-roll RFID production mean?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">RFID inlays and tags are produced on a continuous web, with antenna, chip or strap attach, lamination, converting and test integrated into the production line. The finished material is then supplied on a roll or converted into the required tag format.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Is every tag tested before it ships?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Every inlay and tag is encoded and read-verified before shipment, with unique-ID handling and per-unit traceability.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What makes an industrial RFID tag different from a label?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Industrial RFID tags use a built construction designed for the mounting surface and operating environment. This can include encapsulation, ruggedized materials and on-metal antenna designs that allow a UHF tag to remain readable when mounted against metal.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What read range can industrial UHF tags achieve?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Read range depends on tag construction, mounting surface and reader configuration, so it is established for each program. Every tag is encoded and read-verified before shipment.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:32px;"><a href="/markets/rfid" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the RFID market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your tag or inlay program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>

